      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Todd, \n\nOur custom heap pass some information through the heap flags, but from the upstream code, the heap flags mask all bits from include/uapi/linux/dma-heap.h.\n\n/* Currently no heap flags */\n#define DMA_HEAP_VALID_HEAP_FLAGS (0)\n\nWithout this check of vendor_hook, we need to modify the DMA_HEAP_VALID_HEAP_FLAGS define, but we can not modify native code under GKI. \n\nSo here we propose a vendor_hook. \n\nThanks,\nDavidwang",
